# Keybindings

Z3rm ships platform keymaps and overlays under `assets/keymaps/`. The active keymap is the authority; this page avoids hard-coding platform modifier names that can drift.

## Core fallback actions

Native actions remain available for session attach/detach, new/close tab, split pane, pane focus, settings, command palette, and server/session termination even when QuickJS chrome is unavailable.

Open the keymap editor to inspect or override the binding for an action. Conflicts are shown with the platform's spoken modifier names.
